<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>Vacation Mode lets you pause purchases on your shop listings when you're away or unable to ship within the 2-day window. Turn it on anytime in the app to temporarily stop new out-of-show orders.</p>
        <p>Vacation Mode only applies to listings outside of shows. It doesn't pause orders placed during shows, including Auction or Buy It Now listings.</p>

        <h2 id="how-it-works">How Vacation Mode works</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Your out-of-show listings are temporarily hidden from your shop</li>
            <li>Buyers see an "On vacation" message on your profile</li>
            <li>You'll need to turn Vacation Mode off before buyers can place new out-of-show orders</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="turn-on-off">Turn Vacation Mode on or off</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>From the app, tap <strong>Seller Hub</strong> at the bottom of the screen.</li>
            <li>Tap the <strong>menu icon</strong> in the top right.</li>
            <li>Scroll down and toggle <strong>Vacation Mode</strong> on.</li>
        </ol>

        <p>When you're ready to start selling again, follow the same steps to turn Vacation Mode off.</p>

